# Rockfall net (one-way; top 4 px = walking surface): a d edge rope with an
# i highlight between k lines over the full tile width, a 1 px d diamond
# mesh (period 8) stretched back to a d rope in row 11. End tiles: a 4 px
# steel post k|i|m|k in columns 6-9 with a d clamp every 8 px, full tile
# height (continued to the ground by netz_post); the mesh stops at the post,
# the rope runs on to a k end cap. Transparent between the mesh.
# Only the left/right bits change the look.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_netz
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
